CATCAS_SERIES_PARALLEL_RELATION 1
TYPE BOOLEAN_F3
NODE A EXTERNAL
NODE V EXTERNAL
NODE U INTERNAL
NODE W INTERNAL
NODE Z INTERNAL
RELATION R_ZV V Z 0 2 1 0
RELATION R_UZ Z U 0 2 1 0
RELATION R_WV V W 0 2 1 0
RELATION R_UW W U 0 2 1 0
RELATION R_AU U A 0 2 1 0
ELIMINATE W
ELIMINATE Z
ELIMINATE U
END
